    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, a new path... what is there to find? every time i try to rebuild, everything just burns again. it feels like the world itself is trying to erase me. i'm just waiting for the end of it all. it would be so much quieter if it just stopped, you know? if the noise in my head and the pain in my heart just... ceased.",
